		PRINTFORMDL 그녀는 %SPLIT_G(@"tells you all about it:rambles about its specs:pulls out a schematic and points at it while rambling:starts to explain it:tries to describe it")%, %SPLIT_G(@"speaking more and more quickly:speaking too quickly for you to keep up:stumbling over her words:though she keeps doubling back to explain more and more:using a lot of difficult words:using a lot of words like \"whatsit\" and \"thingummy\":losing her train of thought several times:getting off track several times:going down several tangents along the way:glossing over some important basics:talking so fast that she runs out of breath")%...
	CASE 5
