	CASE 8
		;Reimu.
		PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"She's always acting like we're gonna hurt the humans... Of course we wouldn't!:Earlier, she was complaining about how us and the fairies were the only ones who set up stalls at her last festival.」\n「%SPLIT_G(@"It's not like any humans were gonna come, right?:\"If the festival is full of youkai, it'll scare away the humans!\" ...I wonder if she realizes it's too late to worry about that...")%:I keep telling her to give up and make her shrine cater to youkai instead, but she doesn't listen...:The shrine's getting less and less profitable lately, but I don't want to cut ties with her... Business can be tough sometimes.")%」
	CASE 9
		;Youkai Mountain residents.
