;The first time you talk to her after a project is done, Nitori will tell you it's finished and what she's going to work on next.
;The projects will progress in order until they're exhausted, at which point they'll cycle randomly as revamps.

@K51_EGG_PROJECT_CHANGE(Counter)
#DIM DYNAMIC Counter
IF !RAND:3
	LOCALS '= @"나는 %SPLIT_G(@"finally :already :now ::")%%SPLIT_G(@"finished:completed")% %SPLIT_G(@"the:my")%했다"
	LOCALS:1 =
ELSE
	LOCALS '= @"%SPLIT_G(@"The:My")%"
	LOCALS:1 '= @" 은 %SPLIT_G(@"%SPLIT_G(@"finally :already :now ::")%%SPLIT_G(@"done:finished:complete:ready")%:%SPLIT_G(@"done:finished:complete:ready")% at last:is already %SPLIT_G(@"done:finished:complete:ready")%")%"
ENDIF
CALL K51_EGG_CONVERSATION_MESSAGE(0,,,Counter)
PRINTFORML 「%LOCALS% %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME()%%LOCALS:1%!」
PRINTFORMDL 니토리(Nitori)는 그녀의 프로젝트 성공을 당신에게 %SPLIT_G(@"announces:declares")%%SPLIT_G(@"while beaming with pride:with a wide grin:while pumping her fist:while throwing up her hands:and cheers:with excitement:in a loud voice:while balling her fists in excitement:with a bright smile")%로 건넨다.
PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"It was kinda surprisingly tricky...:Heh, heh. It wasn't a problem at all!:Compared to the %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME(1)%, %SPLIT_G(@"it was nothing:it was a lot harder:it was easy:it went fine:it was more fun to work on:I think I did a better job")%!:I think I outdid myself this time!:Heh heh heh, I knew I could do it!:You've gotta see it! It's great!:It's sure to make a big profit once I put it to use!:Feels kinda tiring... but I'm already ready for something new!:Now I can finally get started on something new!:Hee hee, what should I do next?:Thanks for your support, %K51_EGG_MASTER()%!")%」
;If we haven't exhausted the possible projects, go on to the lowest uncompleted one, otherwise set it randomly.
;In theory, this system should be update-proof so more projects can be added on.
CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECTS_COMPLETE++
IF CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECTS_COMPLETE < K51_EGG_MAX_PROJECTS-1
	CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PREVIOUS_PROJECT = CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECT
	CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECT = CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECTS_COMPLETE
	CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECT_DAYS = DAY+RAND(24,35)
	LOCALS = %SPLIT_G(@"나의 최신 아이디어인 새로운 :나의 %SPLIT_G(@"design:schematic:plan:blueprint")%를 위한")% %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME()%
ELSE
	CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECTS_COMPLETE--
	$REPEAT
	LOCAL = RAND:K51_EGG_MAX_PROJECTS
	SIF LOCAL == K51_EGG_PROJECT || LOCAL == K51_EGG_PREVIOUS_PROJECT
		GOTO REPEAT
	CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PREVIOUS_PROJECT = CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECT
	CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECT = LOCAL
	CFLAG:51:K51_EGG_PROJECT_DAYS = DAY+RAND(24,35)
	LOCALS = %SPLIT_G(@"새로운 버전의:개선된:새롭고 향상된:업그레이드된")% %K51_EGG_PROJECT_NAME()%%SPLIT_G(@" 디자인: 도면: 계획: 청사진::")%
ENDIF
PRINTFORML 「%SPLIT_G(@"All right! :I've decided! :I've already got it figured out! :I've already got another idea! :::")%%SPLIT_G(@"My next project will be:Next, I'll work on:Next, I'll make:I'm going to %SPLIT_G(@"make:build")%:I'll try making:For my next project, I'll %SPLIT_G(@"make:build")%:For the next one, I'm going to %SPLIT_G(@"make:build")%")% %LOCALS%!」
WAIT

